# Safety net: a plain `vercel deploy` from the repository root must
# never upload source code (it once did — a 358 MB "deployment" that
# briefly served the repo as static files). Anchored patterns only
# match when the deploy root IS the repo; `make deploy-web` deploys
# from build/web and is unaffected.
